  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "number": 1,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate the following prefix expression if all numbers are single digits:\n\n`* + 3 9 - 8 2`",
        "zh": "如果下方所有数字都是一位数,请计算下方前缀表达式:\n\n`* + 3 9 - 8 2`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "72",
            "zh": "72"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "60",
            "zh": "60"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "48",
            "zh": "48"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "33",
            "zh": "33"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "8",
            "zh": "8"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **A**.\n\nIn evaluating a prefix expression, use 2 operands preceded by an operator from left to right:\n\n`* + 3 9 - 8 2`\n\n= * (3 + 9) (8 − 2) = (3 + 9) * (8 − 2) = 12 * 6 = 72",
        "zh": "答案：**A**。\n\n前缀式的第一个符号 `*` 是最外层运算。它的两个完整操作数是 `+ 3 9` 和 `- 8 2`，分别得 12 和 6。最后 $12\\times6=72$。"
      },
      "source": {
