    {
      "id": "q2",
      "number": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate the following postfix expression if all numbers are single digits:\n\n`9 8 - 5 2 ^ + 8 5 + /`",
        "zh": "如果下方所有数字都是一位数,请计算下方后缀表达式:\n\n`9 8 - 5 2 ^ + 8 5 + /`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "13",
            "zh": "13"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "8",
            "zh": "8"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "4",
            "zh": "4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "2",
            "zh": "2"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "1",
            "zh": "1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "D"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **D**.\n\nIn evaluating a postfix expression, use 2 operands followed by an operator from left to right:\n\n`9 8 - 5 2 ^ + 8 5 + /`\n\n`= (9 - 8) (5 ^ 2) + (8 + 5) /`\n\n= ((9 − 8) + (5 ^ 2)) / (8 + 5) = (1 + 25) / 13 = 26 / 13 = 2",
        "zh": "答案：**D**。\n\n最后一个后缀运算符是除法。分子来自前一段 $(9-8)+5^2=1+25=26$，分母来自后面的 $8+5=13$。最后 $26/13=2$。"
      },
      "source": {
