    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert the following infix expression to prefix:\n\n$$\n\\frac{5+4^{2}}{9-3*2}\n$$",
        "zh": "请将下方中缀表达式转换为前缀表达式:\n\n$$\n\\frac{5+4^{2}}{9-3*2}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ + 5 ^ 4 2 9 - * 3 2`",
            "zh": "`/ + 5 ^ 4 2 9 - * 3 2`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ + ^ 5 4 2 - * 9 3 2`",
            "zh": "`/ + ^ 5 4 2 - * 9 3 2`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ + 5 ^ 2 4 - 9 * 3 2`",
            "zh": "`/ + 5 ^ 2 4 - 9 * 3 2`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "`+ / 5 ^ 4 2 - 9 * 3 2`",
            "zh": "`+ / 5 ^ 4 2 - 9 * 3 2`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ + 5 ^ 4 2 - 9 * 3 2`",
            "zh": "`/ + 5 ^ 4 2 - 9 * 3 2`"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "E"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **E**.\n\nTo convert an infix expression to prefix, use the order of operation:\n\n$$\n\\frac{5+4^{2}}{9-3*2}\n$$\n\n= (5 + 4 ^ 2) / (9 − 3 * 2) = (5 + (^ 4 2)) / (9 − (* 3 2)) = (+ 5 ^ 4 2) / (− 9 * 3 2) = / + 5 ^ 4 2 − 9 * 3 2",
        "zh": "答案：**E**。\n\n分子先算 $4^2$，前缀为 `+ 5 ^ 4 2`。分母先算 $3\\times2$，前缀为 `- 9 * 3 2`。外层除号写在这两个子式之前。"
      },
      "source": {
