    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert the following infix expression to postfix:\n\n3 * 5 − 9 / 3 ^ 2 + 7",
        "zh": "请将下方中缀表达式转换为后缀表达式:\n\n3 * 5 − 9 / 3 ^ 2 + 7"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "`5 3 * 3 9 2 ^ / - 7 +`",
            "zh": "`5 3 * 3 9 2 ^ / - 7 +`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "`3 5 * 9 3 2 ^ / - 7 +`",
            "zh": "`3 5 * 9 3 2 ^ / - 7 +`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "`3 5 * 9 3 ^ 2 / - 7 +`",
            "zh": "`3 5 * 9 3 ^ 2 / - 7 +`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "`3 5 * 9 3 2 ^ / 7 - +`",
            "zh": "`3 5 * 9 3 2 ^ / 7 - +`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "`3 5 9 3 2 7 * ^ / - +`",
            "zh": "`3 5 9 3 2 7 * ^ / - +`"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **B**.\n\nPlace each operator after its two operands, preserving precedence.\n\n```text\n(3 * 5) - (9 / (3 ^ 2)) + 7\n= (3 5 *) - (9 (3 2 ^) /) + 7\n= ((3 5 *) (9 3 2 ^ /) -) 7 +\n= 3 5 * 9 3 2 ^ / - 7 +\n```\n\nSource correction: the two intermediate divisions were mistakenly printed as subtraction in the original solution.",
        "zh": "答案：**B**。\n\n两个优先运算块分别写为 `3 5 *` 和 `9 3 2 ^ /`，因为分母要先算 $3^2$。同级加减从左向右，在两段后接减号，再接 `7 +`。原解析中间曾把除号写成减号，此处保留题面的除法。"
      },
