    {
      "id": "q5",
      "number": 5,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Rank the values of the following expressions from smallest to largest. Expressions a and b are in postfix and c and d are in prefix notation.\n\n- a. `8 4 − 2 /`\n- b. `8 4 2 − /`\n- c. `− / 8 4 2`\n- d. `− 8 / 4 2`",
        "zh": "请将下方表达式的值按照从小到大的顺序进行排序。表达式a和b是后缀表达式,c和d是前缀表达式。\n\n- a. `8 4 − 2 /`\n- b. `8 4 2 − /`\n- c. `− / 8 4 2`\n- d. `− 8 / 4 2`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "c, b, d, a",
            "zh": "c, b, d, a"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "c, a, d, b",
            "zh": "c, a, d, b"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "c, a, b, d",
            "zh": "c, a, b, d"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "a, b, c, d",
            "zh": "a, b, c, d"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "d, c, b, a",
            "zh": "d, c, b, a"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\nEach of the following expressions is evaluated as follows: a. 8 4 − 2 / = (8 − 4) / 2 = 4 / 2 = 2 b. 8 4 2 − / = 8 / (4 − 2) = 8 / 2 = 4 c. − / 8 4 2 = (8 / 4) − 2 = 2 − 2 = 0 d. − 8 / 4 2 = 8 − (4 / 2) = 8 − 2 = 6 Therefore, the order from lowest value to highest value is c, a, b, d.",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n分别按每个式子的前缀或后缀顺序归并。a 得 $(8-4)/2=2$，b 得 $8/(4-2)=4$，c 得 $8/4-2=0$，d 得 $8-4/2=6$。由小到大是 c、a、b、d。"
      },
