      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert the following postfix expression to prefix:\n\n`5 3 * 6 2 / + 2 3 ^ - 5 /`",
        "zh": "请将下方后缀表达式转换为前缀表达式:\n\n`5 3 * 6 2 / + 2 3 ^ - 5 /`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "`- * 5 3 / 6 2 ^ + 2 3 / 5`",
            "zh": "`- * 5 3 / 6 2 ^ + 2 3 / 5`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ - + * 3 5 / 2 6 ^ 5 3 2`",
            "zh": "`/ - + * 3 5 / 2 6 ^ 5 3 2`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ - + * / ^ 5 3 6 2 2 3 5`",
            "zh": "`/ - + * / ^ 5 3 6 2 2 3 5`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ + - * 5 3 / 6 2 ^ 2 3 5`",
            "zh": "`/ + - * 5 3 / 6 2 ^ 2 3 5`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ - + * 5 3 / 6 2 ^ 2 3 5`",
            "zh": "`/ - + * 5 3 / 6 2 ^ 2 3 5`"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "E"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **E**.\n\nTo convert a postfix expression to prefix, put the operator before the operands as opposed to after the operands:\n\n`5 3 * 6 2 / + 2 3 ^ - 5 /`\n\n`= (5 3 *) (6 2 /) + (2 3 ^) - 5 /`\n\n= ((((5 3 *) (6 2 /) +) (2 3 ^) −) 5 /)\n\n`= (- (+ * 5 3 / 6 2) (^ 2 3)) 5 /`\n\n= / − + * 5 3 / 6 2 ^ 2 3 5",
        "zh": "答案：**E**。\n\n按后缀顺序得到分子 $(5\\times3+6/2)-2^3$，分母 5。先把分子化成 `- + * 5 3 / 6 2 ^ 2 3`，再把除号写在分子和 5 之前。"
      },
